  "summary": "完整行限正文讨论男命顺行：戊辰至壬申诸限因先后天吉化、双禄和化权强旺，忌冲多解释为辛劳。癸酉忌煞交冲及贪狼化忌不利，仍因大限事业宫双禄吉辅、破军化禄吉化先天迁移而可缓解，但须小心行事，不可抹掉极端劳碌与不利条件。",
  "summary_en": "The readable discussion follows a male chart through forward major cycles. From Wu Chen through Ren Shen, favorable natal and cycle influences, double Lu and Quan often reduce adverse transformations to toil. Geng Wu still has double Ji constraining the natal Life Palace despite favorable support. Gui You is explicitly adverse: the cycle Life Palace suffers harmful clashes and Tan Lang Hua Ji strikes the natal Life Palace. Natal double Lu supports the cycle Career Palace, while Po Jun Hua Lu favors the natal Travel Palace, so careful conduct may avert major harm despite extreme effort. Disordered chart material and the opening continuation are excluded.",
